  "semantic_rules": [
    "Every edge assertion must state the relationship, its traversal boundary, and whether it can authorize an external claim.",
    "Templated labels and the legacy rationale field are not sufficient assertion bases.",
    "Every assertion basis must resolve to the frozen edge rule plus exact node, skill-row, evidence, endpoint, or W1 baseline references.",
    "Relationship bridges must be explicitly non-causal unless separately evidenced.",
    "Embedding similarity cannot create, validate, or expand an edge assertion."
